Rename this file to exactly the filename Google Search Console gives you
(e.g. googleXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX.html) and put it in your Vite `public/` folder
so it's served as a static file at the site root — that's what Vercel/Netlify/etc.
copy verbatim into the deploy output.

The file's CONTENTS must be exactly the one line GSC shows you, e.g.:

google-site-verification: googleXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX.html

Verify it's live before clicking "Verify" in Search Console:
https://your-domain.com/googleXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX.html
should return that exact line as plain text, nothing else.
